{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"436026d30e1a3758","type":"text","text":"Sheltered Divot\nMain Camp\n\n3 tents\n- Lion hold\n- Nobles\n- Unknown\n\nCovered tables, set up for eating and workspaces","x":-200,"y":-220,"width":360,"height":360,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"350019bae9ee8a98","type":"text","text":"#### Ankheg Hunting Grounds\n\nDry powder, sandy\nCracking sound, rumbling\n\nAmbushed by two ankhegs\n\nThrew one off with Thunderwave, thodunn cut another down.\nA third surprised Aru,\nAnd a 4th appeared after the boom from thundewave\n\nOne shot by caenis\nOne detonated by Kaulinan\n\nRetrieved 11Ankheg eyes which can be consumed","x":-610,"y":264,"width":320,"height":439,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"2942eb6f5523d172","type":"file","file":"Assets/Maps/Ankheg Fight.png","x":-1040,"y":341,"width":400,"height":341},
		{"id":"a9025b046107acfe","type":"text","text":"#### Crossways\nSerpentine shaped Stone atop mound\nTwigs and small bones at base left by animals\nAbandoned creature nest (perhaps manticore)\nNatural stone but brought from a different location","x":-290,"y":820,"width":390,"height":260},
		{"id":"ffb36a843bdb24ac","type":"text","text":"","x":-450,"y":-420,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"63cd0ae58566df10","type":"text","text":"","x":220,"y":-450,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"cf455a852330a9ce","type":"text","text":"Moist and shaded area\nlimited light in canyon\nGain in elevation\nDrips of water and puddles off wall\n\nPuddles are moving\n\nSlithering trackers\nLighting storm\n\nBoulder falls upon caenis\nKaulinana tries to burn the crevasse as we pass\n\nFind a desiccated human skeleton that we rebury\nPotable water source? Maybe needs cleaning","x":-560,"y":1260,"width":400,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c42edb4b2925f82c","type":"text","text":"#### Wet Cave\nopening\nLong gelatinous strands\nSmell of putrescent rot\n\nMovement\n\nWebs are not adhesive\nAlso not flammable\n\nOoze?\nShapes moving around the large caverns\nGiant wet spiders\n\nLeft a danger marking in charcoal\n\nRotting smell of carcasses trapped in webs other side of cave","x":-770,"y":1800,"width":410,"height":480,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"16a3c95da6430419","type":"file","file":"Assets/Maps/Wet Cave 2.png","x":-1197,"y":1800,"width":400,"height":440},
		{"id":"dbee631026f4d5c2","type":"text","text":"### Elven Ruin\n\nWhite marble structure\nPartially collapsed no roof\nHouse 70x40ft\nOvergrown\nWords on the whistling wind in elvish:\n> \"city of cities, open the way\"\n\nTwo rooms, main chamber and a side room on the West\nArchitecture is reminiscent of kathkachan tunnel warren\n\nStone Tablet\nEveryone's skin goes cold\nAllip\n\n> \"The last mandate, they must not reach the answer\"\n> \"They must not have it, please let them not reach it\"\n> \"I'm sorry, please\"\n> \"Liars and thieves\"\n> \"please leave\"\n\n\n\n\n\n","x":-420,"y":2460,"width":475,"height":600},
		{"id":"9c179376fc9e71e1","type":"file","file":"Assets/Maps/Elven Ruin.png","x":-978,"y":2460,"width":543,"height":600},
		{"id":"3e736223ef314a88","type":"text","text":"### Manticore Lair\n\nPlateau\nSmell of blood\n\nDead body of a giant\nManticore with a mane feasting on the giant, roars like a lion\n\nRemains distributed in the nest are similar to those around the serpentine statue","x":-75,"y":3240,"width":515,"height":540,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"e221ba45de0dde29","type":"file","file":"Assets/Maps/Manticore Lair.png","x":-640,"y":3240,"width":539,"height":540},
		{"id":"2a09d74bc732f13f","type":"text","text":"","x":165,"y":540,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"839a8becea920803","type":"text","text":"","x":120,"y":341,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"391e719fe630b41d","x":520,"y":1420,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":""},
		{"id":"9b4c0ddcddb040bb","type":"text","text":"### Arid Highland\nVery arid windblasted area\nBarren\nSteppe\nGoblin figure, armed\n\"Oh shit oh god\"\n\nGoblin and giant camp\n\nYou may call me Nek\n","x":457,"y":1760,"width":376,"height":340},
		{"id":"97423323147426c9","x":749,"y":2378,"width":351,"height":322,"type":"text","text":"### Whistling Redoubt\n\nCrevasse passable by giants\nManned by goblins and hobgoblins\nLarge dogs with heavy collars\n"},
		{"id":"ea6f45f65a994d96","x":720,"y":3298,"width":363,"height":382,"type":"text","text":"### Humanoid Encampment\nEncampment for other humanoids\nDogs barking\nHumans orcs dwarves\n\nRemnants of dog prince\nRowan\nKana will be pleased to hear you are alive and doing well\n\n"},
		{"id":"9c4f1886974a3a43","x":1020,"y":2920,"width":250,"height":100,"type":"text","text":"### Crossroads\nJust a basic path change"},
